        "original_id": "ea54142a-20d3-5079-bd5d-167f6545dadd",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Carla Gugino\n- Organizations: Warner Bros.\n- Products: Son in Law, Sin City, Night at the Museum, Mr. Popper's Penguins, San Andreas, The Space Between Us, Gerald's Game\n- Systems: DC Extended Universe\n- Concepts: American actress, media franchise, shared universe\n\nFacts:\n- Carla Gugino was born on August 29, 1971, and she is an American actress.\n- Carla Gugino starred in the feature film Son in Law in 1993.\n- Carla Gugino starred in the feature film Sin City in 2005.\n- Carla Gugino starred in the feature film Night at the Museum in 2006.\n- Carla Gugino starred in the feature film Mr. Popper's Penguins in 2011.\n- Carla Gugino starred in the feature film San Andreas in 2015.\n- Carla Gugino starred in the feature films The Space Between Us and Gerald's Game in 2017.\n- Carla Gugino also played Kelor in the DC Extended Universe.\n- The DC Extended Universe, also referred to in the chunk as the Justice League Universe, is an American media franchise and shared universe centered on superhero films distributed by Warner Bros.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
